// IntroString :
"P3922036447" "It has become clear that the Tears of the Spirit cannot be allowed to remian in Scirocco's hands. Nor can they go to Ghost Widow. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You, {VillainName}, are the duly appointed Arachnos representative in charge of retrieving the Tears from Scirocco.</A> Do so without delay. <br><br>I hear the the Tears are guarded by Scirocco's most trusted servant, Ice Mistral. I recommend you take a full team with you; if Ice Mistral opposes you, she will not be easily dealt with."
// AcceptString :
"P1463170286" "Retrieve the Tears of the Spirit from Scirocco"
// SendOffString :
"P3996562597" "Do not be tempted to drink the tears, {VillainName}. Without the proper incantations, they would surely kill you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1941601080" "Retrieve Tears of the Spirit"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P988524564" "We must confiscate the Tears of the Spirit before this conflict grows more bloody."

