"P3299610318" "I feared it might come to this. Ghost Widow and Scirocco are at one another's throats. Confiscating the Tears of the Spirit won't be enough, {VillainName}!  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We have to destroy it!</A> I know Ghost Widow will have Wretch guarding her prize. Teach her a lesson by taking him down. You may well need a full team to do so."
